doubtful cases shall be resolved in favor of coverage.  For a particular
product received by a consumer, "normally used" means a typical or
common use.  For a particular product received by a consumer, "normally
used" is not determined by whether the product is actually used in a
particular way, or by whether the product is actually used by a
particular class of consumer, or by whether the product is actually
used in a particular country.  For a particular product received by a
